OL,3,GNEWSAAnnual New Year's Day swim axed
OL,4,Aafter sea deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn annual charity sea swim in aid of a
OL,7,Ftown's lifeboat has been axed after the
OL,8,Fdeaths earlier this year of four people
OL,9,Foff the Yorkshire coast.
OL,11,FHornsea Inshore Rescue, which organises
OL,12,Fthe New Year's Day Swim in Hornsea,
OL,13,Fsaid it had made the "difficult
OL,14,Fdecision" to end one of its biggest
OL,15,Ffundraising events after the "tragic
OL,16,Floss of lives along our coastline".
OL,18,FIn January, 15-year-old Grace Keeling,
OL,19,Fher mother Sarah and passerby Mark
OL,20,FRatcliffe died in the sea off
OL,21,FWithernsea. In August, Abdi Zubeir, 13,
OL,22,Fdrowned at Hornsea.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
