OL,3,GNEWSAAnnual New Year's Day swim axed
OL,4,Aafter sea deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a post on social media, the charity
OL,7,Fsaid it felt it could "no longer
OL,8,Fjustify encouraging people to enter the
OL,9,FNorth Sea, particularly during the
OL,10,Fharsh conditions of January".
